 hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134921079.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Karnataka's deputy chief minister has set an ambitious target for the state to become a leader in disaster risk reduction by 2030. He underscores the significance of integrated strategies that not only protect livelihoods but also enhance community resilience. Collaboration among various departments is essential to improve disaster preparedness, particularly for vulnerable groups.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/karnataka-sets-2030-goal-to-strengthen-disaster-prevention-and-resilience/articleshow/134921079.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/karnataka-sets-2030-goal-to-strengthen-disaster-prevention-and-resilience/articleshow/134921079.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:39:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921179,imgsize-59781.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sunak meets Modi, hails his leadership as UK-India ties go ‘from strength to strength’]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sunak-meets-modi-hails-his-leadership-as-uk-india-ties-go-from-strength-to-strength/articleshow/134920638.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134920638.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sunak-meets-modi-hails-his-leadership-as-uk-india-ties-go-from-strength-to-strength/articleshow/134920638.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sunak-meets-modi-hails-his-leadership-as-uk-india-ties-go-from-strength-to-strength/articleshow/134920638.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:15:48+05:30</pubDa