e idol after examination and has introduced a three-year deadline for excavation projects. A preliminary excavation at Ujjain's Vaishya Tekri aims to determine the significance of newly identified structures. ASI is also addressing funding disparities based on visitor numbers and maintenance needs at various sites.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/weve-found-missing-head-of-11th-century-khajuraho-vishnu-idol-will-be-restored-soon-asi-chief/articleshow/134920422.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/weve-found-missing-head-of-11th-century-khajuraho-vishnu-idol-will-be-restored-soon-asi-chief/articleshow/134920422.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:08:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pankul Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134920586,imgsize-171382.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Lady hiding in Dehradun': Who was Rahul Gandhi referring to at INDIA bloc presser?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lady-hiding-in-dehradun-who-was-rahul-gandhi-referring-to-at-india-bloc-presser/articleshow/134919566.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134919566.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During the INDIA bloc's press conference, Rahul Gandhi's reference to a "lady hiding right now in Dehradun" raised questions about whom he was referring to. The remark came amid the opposition's campaign against CEC Gyanesh Kumar over alleged electoral-roll irregularities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lady-hiding-in-dehradun-who-was-rahul-gandhi-referring-to-at-india-bloc-presser/articleshow/134919566.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lady-hiding-in-dehradun-who-was-rahul-gandhi-referring-to-at-india-bloc-presser/articleshow/134919566.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T19:35:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134919668,imgsize-1457760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Agreed to build on positive momentum in ties': PM Modi speaks with Canada PM Mark Carney]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/agreed-to-build-on-positive-momentum-in-ties-pm-modi-speaks-with-canada-pm-mark-carney/articleshow/134919669.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134919669.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Prime Minister Narendra Modi and Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney discussed enhancing the strategic partnership between India and Canada. The leaders emphasized collaboration on trade, energy, technology, and security matters. Both nations aim to finalize a Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement by December to boost bilateral trade significantly. Modi's potential visit to Canada would mark his first since diplomatic tensions arose previously.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/agreed-to-build-on-positive-momentum-in-ties-pm-modi-speaks-with-canada-pm-mark-carney/articleshow/134919669.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/agreed-to-build-on-positive-momentum-in-ties-pm-modi-speaks-with-canada-pm-mark-carney/articleshow/134919669.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T19:17:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134919708,imgsize-65670.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Absence from draft SIR doesn't mean deletion': EC to Bombay HC]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/absence-from-